      "content": "Map the replay meter before the `waiting` return and include it in that branch as well. An Open Trade awaiting its first close has `firstMarksDue`, but its Stop/Target outcomes are still available (they do not require a Mark), so `replayTrade` can supply a valid reading with an unavailable `now`. Currently that reading is discarded before reaching this line, hiding the dashed track on this Open Detail. Add a test with `firstMarksDue` set and an unavailable meter reading; the existing missing-Mark test does not exercise this branch.",
